sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 临床用户
    participant W as Enterprise WeCom
    participant G as WeCom Gateway
    participant I as Service Intake
    participant DB as Pilot PostgreSQL
    participant P as Pilot Ticket Core
    participant O as Outbox/Delivery
    participant A as AI/OCR (Phase 2)

    U->>W: @信息保障助手 + 文字/截图
    W->>G: WebSocket Frame
    G->>I: 标准化消息
    I->>DB: 幂等保存 Channel Message / Intake
    I->>P: 创建 Pilot Ticket（幂等）
    P->>DB: Ticket + Event + Outbox 同事务
    P-->>I: pilot_ticket_no + QUEUED
    I-->>G: 工单号/首次回复模板
    G-->>W: 回复“已生成工单，等待受理”
    W-->>U: 首次确认
    I--)A: Phase 2 异步规则/OCR/AI
    A-->>I: 结构化建议
    P->>DB: 接单/处理/解决 + Event + Outbox
    O->>G: 可靠发送申报人通知
    G->>W: 主动推送
    W->>U: 进度卡片

    Note over P,O: Phase 1 不调用 Hospital Tickets
    Note over P,O: Phase 3 由 Ticket Adapter 承担迁移、同步和对账
